*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0002
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-07-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 233
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> MAXIMUM TERM IN YEARS
    05 TERM-CAP           PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    *> LOAN ELIGIBILITY Y/N
    05 LOAN-ELIGIBLE      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2500-AGE-TERM
    DISPLAY "TERM-CAP=" TERM-CAP
    DISPLAY "LOAN-ELIGIBLE=" LOAN-ELIGIBLE
    STOP RUN.
2500-AGE-TERM.
    IF CLNT-AGE >= 18
        IF CLNT-AGE > 60
            MOVE 10 TO TERM-CAP
            MOVE 'Y' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
        ELSE
            *> MEDIUM TERM CAP - LIMIT 41 PER 1998 POLICY
            IF CLNT-AGE GREATER THAN 55
                MOVE 20 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
            ELSE
                MOVE 30 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
    END-IF.
